<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank calls for repo bids at unch 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank calls for repo bids at unch 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's central bank on Thursday called for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed rate of three percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 10 a.m. (0900 GMT) on Friday, the Austrian National Bank said.</p>
<p>Last week, the bank allotted 1.83 billion schillings in two-week repos, filling two percent of bids.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
